; Verified Reader typesetter theory.
;
; Self-contained: depends only on Stdlib + Crane (for the final extraction
; directives in GlyphLayout.v) + ITree/ExtLib/Paco (pulled in transitively by
; the Crane plugin prelude).  It does NOT depend on the crypto FFI files
; (CryptoSpec.v etc.) and pulls in no OpenSSL, so it typechecks in the bare
; crane-blog:builder image with `dune build`.
;
; Theory name [Typeset] so modules are addressed as [Typeset.Boxes] etc.,
; disjoint from the [FormalBlog] theory in ../dune.
(coq.theory
 (name Typeset)
 (package crane_blog)
 (theories Stdlib Crane ITree ExtLib Paco)
 (plugins rocq-crane.plugin))

; @proofs alias — Typeset is a sibling theory with no inbound dependents that
; force every module to build: dune's coq.theory compiles .vo files lazily per
; module, so Tests.v (the typesetter test suite: TeX-parity, T6 optimality and
; monotonicity fixtures) was never built by any target.  Depending on the .vo
; TARGETS makes [dune build @proofs] machine-check every Typeset module,
; including Tests.vo.  (Extract.vo runs the typeset_demo Crane extraction as a
; build side-effect; output lands in _build/default/Typeset.)
(rule
 (alias proofs)
 (deps (glob_files *.vo))
 (action (progn)))
